  lines:
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><wave>Welcome home darling~</wave>
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><wiggle a*.5>I know it's a bit messy</wiggle>
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><bounce>But I'm so close to finishing the book!</bounce>
  - <?PlayerTalk><wave>This looks pretty finished though?</wave>
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><wiggle a*.5>Ah, I have to redo that page, the colors fell off</wiggle>
  - <?MementoTwoTalk><bounce>After all, we can't settle for less than perfect!</bounce>
  - <?PlayerTalk><wave>Yeah...
  - <?GoToLevel5> \n
